      "chunk_text": "Customer Atharv Pandey called insurance agent Vikram Patel regarding an issue with his health policy renewal (HP-001234). The agent informed him that the policy expired on the 10th of the month because a payment gateway issue caused the renewal payment to fail. The agent sent an alternative secure payment link via email to re-process the payment and reactivate the policy.",
